      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:40Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, the most readers were in German, with 580 on the same day.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Abu_Ghraib_torture_and_prisoner_abuse:2026-11-12",
